{"version":1,"content":"<p>上午10時許，觀塘成業街19至21號成業工業大廈一單位業主，聯同執達吏上門收樓時，發現單位內有大量爬蟲動物屍體，於是報警。</p><p>警方經初步點算約有20隻龜、2條魚及2隻蜥蜴，遂通知愛護動物協會到場協助處理。</p><p>案件列作殘酷虐待動物，正追查涉案租戶身分。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:21:13.502431+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:28:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:16.126350+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.324755+00:00","content_hash":"e6b87c0c02f1999ef12769f8bc9c49a97484eea16a36011ff45e5ae7be5e22a9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}